ELECTED, CARD_SELECTED, OTP_ACTIVE, SAVING, RESULT]\r\n                  expected_port_calls: [BankRepository.getCards, OtpService.sendMockCode, BankCardRepository.save, OpeningNavigationService.finish]\r\n                - scenario: 保存银行卡失败\r\n                  id: BR-FAILURE\r\n                  linked_acceptance: [AC-4, AC-5, BD-3]\r\n                  expected_phase_seq: [ENTRY, TYPE_SELECTED, CARD_SELECTED, OTP_ACTIVE, SAVING, RESULT]\r\n                  expected_port_calls: [BankCardRepository.save, OpeningNavigationService.finish]\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-repository\r\n        owner: WalletMain data\r\n        module: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: 工程没有银行卡 RDB 数据库和表。\r\n        target_state: BankCardRepository 负责 wallet_bank_cards.rdb 的创建、升级、按完整卡号幂等保存和查询。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n      - node_id: phone-route-wiring\r\n        owner: Phone product shell\r\n        module: Phone\r\n        current_state: Phone navDestinationMap 只注册到 AllBanksPage。\r\n        target_state: Phone 额外注册 BankCardSelectionPage 与 BankCardOpeningResultPage builder，仍只负责目的页装配。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: current_code\r\n          source_ref: 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: observed\r\n          extraction_method: source_read\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets\r\n      - node_id: account-mobile-mock\r\n        owner: AccountManager domain\r\n        module: AccountManager\r\n        current_state: UserProfile 只有登录状态、displayAccount 与头像，AccountService 的 mock 数据没有手机号。\r\n        target_state: UserProfile 增加 mobile 字段，AccountService 初始化与登录 mock 返回固定手机号；WalletMain 只通过 AccountManager index.ets 的 AccountService.getUserProfile 读取。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain, view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_current_code\r\n          source_ref: 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: observed\r\n          extraction_method: source_read_and_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/data/model/UserProfile.ets\r\n          - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n\r\n  - view_id: deployment\r\n    viewpoint_contract: app-deployment@1\r\n    applicability: applicable\r\n    evolution_impact: changed\r\n    stakeholders: [应用打包与运行环境, WalletMain 数据层]\r\n    purpose: 说明本地 HAR、入口 HAP、RDB 文件与账号 mock 的运行落点和失败影响。\r\n    current_state: Phone HAP 装配 WalletMain HAR；WalletMain 无银行卡数据库。\r\n    target_state: 同一应用进程内由 Phone HAP 装配新增页面，WalletMain 在应用沙箱创建 wallet_bank_cards.rdb；不引入远端服务。\r\n    delta: 新增本地持久化与页面注册，不新增模块或跨进程边界。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:walletmain-owns-opening]\r\n    verification_refs: [doc/architecture.md, 02-Feature/WalletMain/oh-package.json5]\r\n    rollout:\r\n      - order: 1\r\n        unit: WalletMain HAR\r\n        depends_on: [AccountManager, CommUI, CommFunc]\r\n        note: 先提供模型、RDB、服务、页面和 builder 导出。\r\n      - order: 2\r\n        unit: Phone HAP\r\n        depends_on: [WalletMain]\r\n        note: 再注册新增目的页并完成真机验收。\r\n    coordination: []\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: local-wallet-runtime\r\n        owner: Phone and WalletMain\r\n        current_state: Phone HAP 与 WalletMain HAR 同进程运行，无银行卡 RDB。\r\n        target_state: 页面仍在同进程，银行卡记录保存于应用沙箱 wallet_bank_cards.rdb。\r\n        responsibilities: [装配 WalletMain 页面, 创建并访问本地银行卡数据库]\r\n        inputs: [用户页面操作, BankRepository mock 数据, AccountService mock 账号]\r\n        outputs: [OpeningResult, StoredCard RDB 记录]\r\n        not_responsible_for: [真实银行网络, 真实短信网关, 真实支付开通]\r\n        failure_impact: RDB 故障只导致本次失败结果，不影响既有银行列表和其它卡种页面。\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: architecture_and_requirement\r\n          source_ref: doc/architecture.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs: [doc/architecture.md, doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md]\r\n\r\n  - view_id: scenarios\r\n    viewpoint_contract: app-scenarios@1\r\n    applicability: applicable\r\n    evolution_impact: changed\r\n    stakeholders: [钱包用户, 产品验收, 测试人员]\r\n    purpose: 从两个入口描述成功、失败、取消和重发场景及参考图对应界面。\r\n    current_state: 用户在银行列表点击后只看到暂不支持。\r\n    target_state: 用户能完成卡型选择、具体卡片选择、验证码、结果处理，并得到一致的取消与失败恢复。\r\n    delta: 新增端到端开卡旅程与四张参考图对应的界面状态。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:result-stack-policy, decision:custom-opening-ui]\r\n    verification_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md]\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: open-card-user-journey\r\n        owner: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: 点击银行后终止。\r\n        target_state: 完成从银行入口到结果页完成的端到端旅程。\r\n        logical_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain, contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n        runtime_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow, view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow]\r\n        development_owner_ref: view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui\r\n        deployment_refs: [view:deployment/node:local-wallet-runtime]\r\n        journey_steps:\r\n          - step_id: J1\r\n            stage: 选择卡型\r\n            user_action: 在添加银行卡页或全部银行页点击银行，选择储蓄卡或信用卡并同意继续。\r\n            system_behavior: 半模态展示该银行信息和支持卡型，最多单选一种。\r\n            preconditions: [银行列表已加载]\r\n          - step_id: J2\r\n            stage: 选择具体卡片\r\n            user_action: 在银行页选择一张掩码卡并同意协议后点击下一步。\r\n            system_behavior: 页面仅显示卡号前四后四，后台保留完整卡号。\r\n            preconditions: [已选择银行和卡型]\r\n          - step_id: J3\r\n            stage: 短信验证\r\n            user_action: 输入六位数字验证码并点击下一步。\r\n            system_behavior: 弹层出现即 mock 发送，显示 60 秒倒计时；合法输入后保存银行卡。\r\n            preconditions: [已选择具体卡片]\r\n          - step_id: J4\r\n            stage: 查看结果并完成\r\n            user_action: 在成功或失败结果页点击完成。\r\n            system_behavior: 成功清栈回钱包首页，失败清栈回最初添加卡片页；结果页禁止返回。\r\n            preconditions: [保存调用已返回结果]\r\n\n===== lines 410-535 =====\r\n          - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankRepository.ets\r\n\r\n  - view_id: runtime\r\n    viewpoint_contract: app-runtime@1\r\n    applicability: applicable\r\n    evolution_impact: changed\r\n    stakeholders: [钱包用户, WalletMain 页面与数据层]\r\n    purpose: 描述从银行点击到结果页完成的导航、状态、写库、失败恢复和首页刷新闭环。\r\n    current_state: 两个银行入口只显示暂不支持，没有后续页面、会话状态或持久化。\r\n    target_state: 两入口进入同一开卡会话；卡型和卡片选择后验证六位验证码，保存结果带完整卡号进入结果页并按结果清栈返回。\r\n    delta: 建立四段用户流程和以 BankCardRepository 为权威的持久化数据流。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:single-opening-session, decision:result-stack-policy]\r\n    verification_refs:\r\n      - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n      - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets\r\n      - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AllBanksPage.ets\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-opening-flow\r\n        owner: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: 银行点击终止在 Toast。\r\n        target_state: 银行点击、卡型选择、卡片选择、验证码、RDB 保存、结果页与完成清栈按顺序闭合。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_code\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        contracts:\r\n          state_management:\r\n            - state_id: opening-session\r\n              ordered_steps:\r\n                - AddBankCardPage 或 AllBanksPage 调用 CardTypeSheet.open(bank)，传入所选 BankInfo；关闭时丢弃未提交选择。\r\n                - CardTypeSheet 只允许选中一个受支持卡型；同意并继续后调用 NavPathContext.stack().pushPath 进入 BankCardSelectionPage，参数包含 bankCode 与 cardType。\r\n                - BankCardSelectionPage 调用 BankRepository.getCards(bankCode, cardType) 返回 1 至 2 张完整 mock 卡；页面只渲染 maskCardNumber(fullNumber)。\r\n                - 用户选卡并同意协议后，BankCardSelectionPage 打开 OtpVerificationSheet，内存参数包含所选完整 BankCardCandidate。\r\n                - OtpVerificationSheet 出现时调用 AccountService.getUserProfile() 取得 UserProfile.mobile，渲染掩码手机号；随后调用 OtpService.sendMockCode(mobile) 并启动 60 秒倒计时，仅接受六位数字，倒计时结束前禁止重发。\r\n                - OtpVerificationSheet 关闭或 aboutToDisappear 时取消 Timer 并清空 otp/sending/saving；关闭验证码弹层只丢弃验证码状态，保留具体卡片页上的当前卡片选择供用户继续。\r\n                - 用户提交验证码后，OtpVerificationSheet 调用 BankCardOpeningService.toStoredCard(candidate) 生成 StoredCard，再调用 BankCardRepository.save(card) 并等待 RDB 返回；服务将成功或异常统一映射为 OpeningResult(fullCardNumber, success, errorMessage)。\r\n                - 页面将 OpeningResult 通过 NavPathStack 参数推入 BankCardOpeningResultPage；结果页禁用返回手势和系统返回。\r\n                - 用户点击完成后，结果页调用 OpeningNavigationService.finish(stack, result)：成功先把 fullCardNumber 写入进程内 BankOpeningCompletionContext，再调用 stack.clear(false) 回根首页；失败调用 stack.popToName('AddBankCardPage', false)，保留最初 AddBankCardPage 并删除 AllBanksPage、选卡页和结果页。\r\n    runtime_data_flows:\r\n      - flow_id: persisted-bank-card-flow\r\n        data_domain_refs: [data-domain:bank-card]\r\n        external_contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n        source_of_truth:\r\n          authority: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n          persistence: wallet_bank_cards.rdb/cards\r\n          projections_and_caches: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n          reconciliation: 每次保存以完整卡号为唯一业务键执行单事务查询后插入；若并发唯一冲突则回查既有记录并视为成功。\r\n        triggers:\r\n          - kind: user_otp_submit\r\n            timing: 用户输入六位数字并点击下一步\r\n            idempotency: 同一完整卡号只保留一条记录；重复提交返回同一保存结果。\r\n        initial_load:\r\n          initial_load_id: opening-card-candidates\r\n          strategy: 页面按 bankCode 与 cardType 从 BankRepository 读取本地 mock 候选；结果页通过 NavPath 参数接收 OpeningResult。\r\n          owner: WalletMain\r\n          data_scope: 当前银行、卡型和已保存银行卡\r\n          freshness: mock 候选为进程内常量；OpeningResult 只对应刚完成的本次保存调用。\r\n        state_owner:\r\n          ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n          states: [saving, saved, save_failed]\r\n        mutations: &flowMutations\r\n          - mutation_id: save-bank-card\r\n            kind: foreground\r\n            persistence_ref: wallet_bank_cards.rdb/cards\r\n            publication_ref: publication:bank-card-saved\r\n            recovery_ref: recovery:save-result\r\n        publications: &flowPublications\r\n          - publication_id: bank-card-saved\r\n            payload: OpeningResult 中的完整卡号、成功标记和错误说明；仅在内存调用链传递，不写日志或界面明文。\r\n          - publication_id: opening-completed\r\n            payload: 成功完成时发布到 BankOpeningCompletionContext 的单次完整卡号；HomeTabPage 消费即清除上下文。\r\n        subscriptions: &flowSubscriptions\r\n          - subscription_id: home-completion-on-appear\r\n            consumer_ref: consumer:wallet-home\r\n            publication_ref: publication:opening-completed\r\n            attach: HomeTabPage.aboutToAppear 调用 BankOpeningCompletionContext.consume()。\r\n            detach: 无常驻监听。\r\n            cleanup: consume() 返回后立即清空 Context 内静态值；页面仅在当前生命周期的 lastOpenedCardNumber 状态中保留，离开页面释放。\r\n            replay_or_snapshot: Context 只保留最近一次尚未消费的成功卡号。\r\n            ordering: 结果页先 publish(fullCardNumber)，再 stack.clear(false) 使 HomeTabPage 出现并消费。\r\n        consumers: &flowConsumers\r\n          - consumer_id: opening-result-page\r\n            initial_load_ref: initial-load:opening-card-candidates\r\n            update_ref: publication:bank-card-saved\r\n          - consumer_id: wallet-home\r\n            initial_load_ref: initial-load:opening-card-candidates\r\n            update_ref: publication:opening-completed\r\n        failure_recovery:\r\n          recovery_id: save-result\r\n          handling: 写库失败仍生成失败 OpeningResult 并进入结果页；数据库不留下半写记录。若写入已提交但进程在结果页 push 前终止，下次重复添加通过完整卡号幂等回查既有记录。\r\n          retry: 本轮结果页不重试，用户点击完成回添加卡片页后可重新开始；进程终止后不恢复未完成页面会话。\r\n        decisions_and_gaps: [decision:card-number-privacy, decision:result-stack-policy]\r\n        evidence_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        logical_contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n        development_owner_ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n        lifecycle_coverage:\r\n          cold_start: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-repository] }\r\n          warm_resume: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          page_attach: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          page_detach: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          account_switch: { status: not_applicable, evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md] }\r\n          process_recreation: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-repository] }\r\n          background_write: { status: not_applicable, evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md] }\r\n        contracts:\r\n          state_management:\r\n            - state_id: persisted-bank-card-flow-mapping\r\n              owner_ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n              contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n              ordered_steps:\r\n                - 验证码提交后把 BankCardCandidate 转为 StoredCard，并调用 BankCardRepository.save。\r\n                - Repository 在单事务内按完整卡号查询后插入，并发唯一冲突回查既有记录。\r\n                - 保存结果映射为 OpeningResult；结果页消费后，成功参数经 CompletionContext 单次交给 HomeTabPage，失败定向返回 AddBankCardPage。\r\n              lifecycle_triggers: [user_otp_submit, result_page_finish, home_tab_appear]\r\n              mutations: *flowMutations\r\n              publications: *flowPublications\r\n              subscriptions: *flowSubscriptions\r\n              consumers: *flowConsumers\r\n        provenance:\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
