ge\r\n      value: 两个页面均使用 BankRepository 的本地 mock 数据，银行点击目前调用 not_supported Toast；导航经 NavPathContext 和 Phone 根 NavPathStack。\r\n      provenance:\r\n        source_kind: current_code\r\n        source_ref: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets\r\n        observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n        evidence_strength: observed\r\n        extraction_method: source_read\r\n      verification_refs: [02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AllBanksPage.ets, 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets]\r\n  conflicts:\r\n    - conflict_id: success-destination-wording\r\n      topic: 成功完成后的目的地\r\n      owner: product requirement owner\r\n      sources:\r\n        - source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md#如果本次添加是成功状态\r\n          statement: 成功后携带卡号跳转到钱包首页，银行卡详情页待后续开发。\r\n        - source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md#添加结果页\r\n          statement: 页面说明段出现点击完成后跳转到卡详情页的文字。\r\n      resolution: numbered_requirement_and_future-note_take_precedence\r\n      conclusion: 当前切片成功回钱包首页并携带完整卡号，卡详情页不在本轮实现。\r\n  inputs:\r\n    knowledge_assets:\r\n      - doc/module-catalog.yaml\r\n      - doc/glossary.yaml\r\n=== development nodes ===\r\n556:      - node_id: bank-card-opening-ui\n557-        owner: WalletMain presentation\n558-        module: WalletMain\n559-        kind: page\n560-        current_state: 只有 AddBankCardPage 与 AllBanksPage，银行点击提示暂不支持。\n561-        target_state: 新增卡型半模态、具体卡片页、验证码半模态和结果页，并把两个入口接到同一流程。\n562-        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain, view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\n563-        provenance:\n564-          source_kind: requirement_and_component_index\n565-          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\n566-          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\n567-          evidence_strength: authoritative\n568-          extraction_method: main_agent_design\n569-        verification_refs:\n570-          - doc/component-index.yaml#WalletMai